  "description": "Operating Area: India\n\nBoarding Point: Jetty no 5, opp Taj Mahal Hotel, Gateway of India.\n\nSun Odyssey 54 is the best and largest mono hull sail-yacht for cruising in India.\nIt can take 18 guests at a time.\nThe yacht provides 3 Bedrooms furnished with Music System, Mobile Charging facilities and Speakers.\nIt is an Italian-made, high performance sail-yacht that sails well in both light and strong winds.\nIt has fully furnished 3 rooms with Italian furniture and 2 well equipped bathrooms.\nA small kitchenette with heating facilities.\nSun Odyessey 54 is used popularly for cruising for Sunset Sails, Long Voyages and by Couples for dining with a good view of The Gateway of India & Taj Mahal Hotel.\nIt is currently the finest sailing yacht in the waters of Mumbai city, sailing on it can be a marvelous experience.",
